WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.006
Erlang quickly tied up Wukong and brought him up to Heaven.

2
00:00:14.007 --> 00:00:20.297
"I want Sun Wukong destroyed," said the Jade Emperor.

3
00:00:20.298 --> 00:00:24.846
Soldiers tied Wukong to a pillar in a courtyard.

4
00:00:24.847 --> 00:00:29.242
[g@They struck him with swords.

5
00:00:29.243 --> 00:00:32.537
But his body was as hard as a diamond.@g]

6
00:00:32.538 --> 00:00:34.763
The swords shattered.

7
00:00:34.764 --> 00:00:39.702
Wukong laughed. "Your swords can't hurt me!"

8
00:00:39.703 --> 00:00:42.613
[g@The Jade Emperor turned to a messenger.

9
00:00:42.614 --> 00:00:47.475
"Bring in the fire gods."@g]

10
00:00:47.476 --> 00:00:53.098
Several fire gods entered the courtyard and threw balls of flame at Wukong.

11
00:00:53.099 --> 00:00:57.187
The courtyard filled with smoke.

12
00:00:57.188 --> 00:01:03.438
But when the smoke cleared, not one hair on Wukong's body was burned.

13
00:01:03.439 --> 00:01:10.385
"Thank you!" Wukong laughed. "I was feeling a little cold!"

14
00:01:10.386 --> 00:01:15.491
"Gather the thunder gods," said the Jade Emperor.

15
00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:19.668
Several thunder gods entered the courtyard.

16
00:01:19.669 --> 00:01:24.536
The Jade Emperor smiled as lightning bolts shot toward Wukong.

17
00:01:24.537 --> 00:01:28.116
But even the lightning couldn't harm the monkey.

18
00:01:28.117 --> 00:01:31.733
"That tickled!" said Wukong with a smile.

19
00:01:31.734 --> 00:01:35.572
[g@The Jade Emperor shook his head.

20
00:01:35.573 --> 00:01:39.257
"It seems that Wukong can't be destroyed."@g]

21
00:01:39.258 --> 00:01:43.213
"That's because he ate all the peaches," said Laozi.

22
00:01:43.214 --> 00:01:46.860
"Just one peach would make someone live forever.

23
00:01:46.861 --> 00:01:50.106
He ate every peach in the garden!"

24
00:01:50.107 --> 00:01:51.680
[g@The emperor frowned.

25
00:01:51.681 --> 00:01:54.455
"Then how will we get rid of him?"@g]

26
00:01:54.456 --> 00:01:57.328
"I have an idea," said Laozi.

27
00:01:57.329 --> 00:02:01.052
"I'll put him in the large pot I use for making potions.

28
00:02:01.053 --> 00:02:03.938
Maybe we can burn him up slowly."

29
00:02:03.939 --> 00:02:09.716
"Perfect," said the Jade Emperor.

30
00:02:09.717 --> 00:02:17.191
Soldiers brought Wukong to a room in Laozi's palace.

31
00:02:17.192 --> 00:02:20.965
A large pot sat in the middle of the room.

32
00:02:20.966 --> 00:02:29.522
Laozi put Wukong into the pot and then closed the lid.

33
00:02:29.523 --> 00:02:33.665
[g@Laozi started a fire under the pot.

34
00:02:33.666 --> 00:02:36.866
Day and night he tended the fire.@g]

35
00:02:36.867 --> 00:02:41.414
He kept it burning for 49 days.

36
00:02:41.415 --> 00:02:51.248
"Wukong must have been destroyed by now," thought Laozi.

37
00:02:51.249 --> 00:02:55.152
He slowly took the lid off the pot.

38
00:02:55.153 --> 00:03:02.001
[g@Smoke poured from the opening, and Wukong leaped out!

39
00:03:02.002 --> 00:03:03.989
The pot fell over.@g]

40
00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:09.356
Burning pieces of coal flew everywhere.

41
00:03:09.357 --> 00:03:12.933
Wukong's eyes were red, and he was coughing.

42
00:03:12.934 --> 00:03:18.024
"That smoke was horrible!" he cried.

43
00:03:18.025 --> 00:03:22.259
He pushed Laozi, knocking the sage onto his back.

44
00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:27.762
Wukong pulled out his iron bar and smashed everything in the room.

45
00:03:27.763 --> 00:03:31.013
"Somebody, stop him!" cried Laozi.

46
00:03:31.014 --> 00:03:35.134
Wukong ran out of Laozi's palace.

47
00:03:35.135 --> 00:03:40.360
Gods and spirits fled as Wukong smashed everything in his path.

48
00:03:40.361 --> 00:03:45.515
Laozi ran into the Cloud Palace.

49
00:03:45.516 --> 00:03:50.537
"Your Majesty, Wukong is causing trouble all over Heaven!" he said.

50
00:03:50.538 --> 00:03:54.781
"What!" cried the emperor. "He's alive?"

51
00:03:54.782 --> 00:03:56.925
"Yes," said Laozi.

52
00:03:56.926 --> 00:04:00.480
"I took the lid off the pot because I thought he was burned up.

53
00:04:00.481 --> 00:04:03.064
But the fire didn't hurt him at all."

54
00:04:03.065 --> 00:04:06.578
"This is an outrage!" said the Jade Emperor.

55
00:04:06.579 --> 00:04:09.664
"What are we going to do with that monkey?"

56
00:04:09.665 --> 00:04:12.844
The emperor thought for a moment.

57
00:04:12.845 --> 00:04:16.152
[g@"We must ask Buddha for help," he said.

58
00:04:16.153 --> 00:04:18.292
He turned to a messenger.@g]

59
00:04:18.293 --> 00:04:20.873
[g@"Go to the Western Paradise quickly.

60
00:04:20.874 --> 00:04:26.529
See if Buddha can come to help us."@g]

61
00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:34.011
Flying as fast as he could, the messenger headed toward the Western Paradise.

62
00:04:34.012 --> 00:04:40.949
Everybody hid indoors as Wukong ran through Heaven.

63
00:04:40.950 --> 00:04:46.531
Using his iron bar, he smashed doors and windows and knocked over statues.

64
00:04:46.532 --> 00:04:49.920
Suddenly he stopped.

65
00:04:49.921 --> 00:04:55.309
Before him was a huge figure, glowing with golden light.

66
00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:58.566
"What do you want?" asked Wukong.

67
00:04:58.567 --> 00:05:02.166
"I am Buddha," said the figure.

68
00:05:02.167 --> 00:05:07.644
"Who are you, and why are you causing all this trouble?"

69
00:05:07.645 --> 00:05:14.465
Wukong smiled. "I am Sun Wukong, king of the Fruit and Flower Mountain.

70
00:05:14.466 --> 00:05:17.605
I should be the king of Heaven too!

71
00:05:17.606 --> 00:05:22.155
I'm going to the Cloud Palace to tell the Jade Emperor to leave.

72
00:05:22.156 --> 00:05:32.707
If he doesn't, I'll never stop causing trouble!"

